hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"441","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"442","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Salih ibn Khawwat that Sahl ibn Abi Hathma related to him that the form of the prayer of fear was that the imam stood with a group of his companions"
"443","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar"
"444","Malik said that Nafi said"
"446","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"447","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from 'Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman from A'isha"
"448","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al Mundhir that Asma bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq said"
"449","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Amr ibn Hazm that he had heard Abbad ibn Tamim say that he had heard Abdullah ibn Zayd al-Mazini say"
"450","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amr ibn Shuayb that the Messenger of Allah"